# Input
```vue
<!-- should not generate diagnostics -->
<script setup>
const items = [{ id: 1, name: "alpha" }];
</script>

<template>
  <button v-if="$slots['icon']">
    <slot name="icon"></slot>
  </button>
  <p>{{ $attrs.class }} {{ $props }} {{ $refs.foo }} {{ $el }} {{ $root }}</p>
  <p v-for="item in items" :key="item.id" @click="$emit('select', item)">
    {{ item.name }}
  </p>
</template>

```
